#
# Agents
#
.agents/plans/**
# ... except the animus docs that are shared work rather than a plan: the running list of issues held back for
# the long build, and the team battleground's design, which carries what the core does and does not allow a
# sim to do with a real Battleground.
!.agents/plans/animus-long-build-fixes/
!.agents/plans/animus-long-build-fixes/animus-long-build-fixes.ANALYSIS.md
!.agents/plans/animus-team-ctf/
